---
title: AdviseCare - State Machine - Referral
---

stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> pending : advisor refers the case
    pending --> accepted : receiver accepts
    pending --> returned : receiver returns it with a reason
    accepted --> [*]
    returned --> [*]
    note right of pending
        one pending referral per case
        it blocks stage changes, reassignment
        and approving a case change request
    end note
